<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Indian Revised Version (IRV) Nagamese</book>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Ephesians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ephesia Logot Paul He Likha Chithi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ephesians</para>
  <para style="toc3">Eph</para>
  <para style="mt">Ephesia Logot Paul He Likha Chithi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1"/>
  <para style="s">Salam Kotha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1"/>Paul, Jisu Khrista laga ekjon apostle pora Ephesus sheher te thaka pobitro khan aru Khrista Jisu logote biswasi thaka khan ke likhi ase. <verse eid="EPH 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2"/>Baba aru, Jisu Khrista laga anugrah aru shanti apuni logote thakibo dibi.<verse eid="EPH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista Te Atma Laga Asirbad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3"/>Jisu Khrista laga Isor aru Baba ke proshansa thakibo dibi, jun pora amikhan ke atma laga sob asirbad dise, Khrista dwara, <verse eid="EPH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4"/>jineka Isor amikhan ke prithibi bona age te bisari loise, tai usorte pobitro aru galti nohoikena thakibo nimite. <verse eid="EPH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5"/>Tai laga itcha te Jisu Khrista dwara amikhan ke Tai nijor laga pali luwa bacha khan hobole basi loise, <verse eid="EPH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6"/>Tai laga anugrah laga mohima juntu Tai amikhan ke ene pora dise Tai laga Sobse Morom Thaka Ekjon dwara, <verse eid="EPH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7"/>Tai laga khun pora he amikhan udhar kori loise, aru Tai laga dangor anugrah te amikhan laga paap sob maph paise, <verse eid="EPH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8"/>sob gyaan aru buddhi pora amikhan ke bhorta kori dise. <verse eid="EPH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9"/>Khrista dwara sorgote aru prithibi te thaka sob manu ke Isor laga asurit kotha koidibole Isor laga itcha korise, <verse eid="EPH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10"/>Isor laga itcha to kineka thik homoi te pura hobo etu he tai laga bhabona ase, aru sorgo aru prithibi te ki jinis khan ase, sob eke logote mili kene Khrista laga age te anibo, <verse eid="EPH 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11"/>Khrista te he amikhan ke Isor laga manu hobole basi loise. Amikhan ke age pora jaga bonai kene rakhise juntu hisab te tai laga itcha pora amikhan ke Isor laga maksad karone basi loise, <verse eid="EPH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12"/>etu nimite he amikhan, jun Khrista uporte poila pora asha rakhise, tai laga mohima hobo nimite aradhana koribo. <verse eid="EPH 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13"/>Apuni khan bhi Khrista ke biswas korise, aru jitia apnikhan laga poritran laga susamachar hunise, aru biswas korise, titia apuni ke Pobitro Atma laga kosom pora mohor lagai dise, <verse eid="EPH 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14"/>aru amikhan nimite pabole thaka to Pobitro Atma pora ji hoilebi rakhi diye, jitia tak amikhan etu pura pai naloi, Tai mohima karone.<verse eid="EPH 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dhanyavad Diya Prathana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15"/>Etu nimite, jitia apuni laga biswas Jisu Khrista te thaka aru apnikhan sob pobitro manu ke morom kora moi hunise, <verse eid="EPH 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16"/>Moi apnikhan nimite dhanyavad dibole rukhanai, moi laga prathana te hodai yaad kori thake, <verse eid="EPH 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17"/>ami laga Probhu Jisu Khrista laga Isor, mohima laga Baba, apnikhan ke Tai laga buddhi laga atma aru Tai laga gyaan apnikhan ke jonai dibo nimite, <verse eid="EPH 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18"/>aru apnikhan laga mon laga suku khuli kene ujala hobo nimite titia apuni janibo paribo kele tai apnikhan ke Tai laga asha te matise aru pobitro khan nimite tai kineka dhun aru mohima rakhi dikene ase etu janibo, <verse eid="EPH 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19"/>aru tulona kori bole napara Tai laga mohan hokti juntu biswas kora khan logot ase, juntu hisab te tai kaam kore, <verse eid="EPH 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20"/>juntu hokti Khrista bhitor te kaam korise, aru Jisu ke mora pora uthai dise aru sorgote Tai laga dyna hathte rakhise, <verse eid="EPH 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21"/>sob niyom, adhikar aru takot pora ki kotha koise khali etiya he nohoi, kintu ahibole yug nimite bhi. <verse eid="EPH 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22"/>Isor sob jinis to tai laga theng nichete rakhise aru sob hokti to taike dise aru sob girja uporte cholawta hobole dise<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Col. 2:10; Psa. 8:6</char></note>, <verse eid="EPH 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23"/>girja to Khrista laga gaw ase aru tai pora he bhorta kore, Tai sob saman ke pura kore aru thik kore.<verse eid="EPH 1:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Biswas Pora Anugraha Paise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1"/>Aru apnikhan poila to kotha namana aru paap te morikene asele, <verse eid="EPH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2"/>utu somoite apuni khan etu prithibi laga niyom hisab te berai thakise, aru apnikhan hawa atma laga takot te berai thakise, juntu atma etiya kotha namane laga manu khan logote kaam kori ase. <verse eid="EPH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3"/>Amikhan bhi taikhan nisena he thakise, biya laga bhabona aru gaw mangso ke khushi koribo dise. Etu nimite, dusra khan nisena he, amikhan to Isor laga khong te julibole thaka bacha khan ase. <verse eid="EPH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4"/>Kintu Isor to daya te bisi dhuni ase, aru tai laga dangor morom pora amikhan ke bisi morom korise. <verse eid="EPH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5"/>Jitia amikhan tai laga kotha namana nimite mori thakise, Tai amikhan ke Khrista logote jinda kori dise- anugrah pora poritran anidise- <verse eid="EPH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6"/>aru Tai logote amikhan bhi jinda uthai dise aru sorgo jaga sob te Jisu Khrista logot bohi bole dise, <verse eid="EPH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7"/>etu nimite ahibole yug te etu jhuki bole napara dangor anugrah ki Tai daya kori kene Jisu Khrista te amikhan ke dikhai dise, etu sobke janai dibo karone ase. <verse eid="EPH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8"/>Kile mane biswas dwara Isor laga anugrah pora apnikhan poritran paise, aru etu to apuni pora aha nohoi, kintu Isor laga bordan ase, <verse eid="EPH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9"/>nijor laga kaam khan pora nohoi, kelemane kun bhi phutani nahobo nimite. <verse eid="EPH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10"/>Kilekoile amikhan tai laga hath pora bona sristikhan ase, aru Khrista Jisu logote bhal kaam kori bole amikhan ke etu jibon dise.<verse eid="EPH 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Khrista Te Sob Ekta Thaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11"/>Etu karone monte rakhibi, ekta somoite apnikhan gaw mangso te Porjati thakise, aru apnikhan “sunnot kora khan” pora “sunnot nakora khan” eneka mati thakise - juntu kaam to manu laga hath pora kora kaam ase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sunnot nakora Porjati</char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12"/>Kilekoile etu somoite apuni khan Khrista pora alag thakise, aru Israel samaj te luwa nai, aru kotha milai luwa laga kosom para apuni khan najana manu khan ase, aru eku asha aru Isor nathaka duniya thakise. <verse eid="EPH 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13"/>Kintu etiya Khrista Jisu te, apuni khan jun poila te tai pora bisi dur thakisele, Khrista laga khun pora usorte ani loise. <verse eid="EPH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14"/>Kile mane Khrista nijor he amikhan laga shanti ase. Tai laga gaw pora duita thaka to ekta kori dise aru juntu diwar pora amikhan ke alag korise etu ke tai bhangai kene khotom kori dise<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal. 3:28; Eph. 2:15.</char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15"/>Tai laga kotha aru Yehudi niyom pora etu sob niyom khan khotom kori dise. Tai laga itcha to duita jat thaka to ekta hoi kene tai logote thaki bole, aru eneka pora he shanti banabo, <verse eid="EPH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16"/>aru etu nimite Khrista laga Cross pora he taikhan majote dushmani thaka to khotom koribo paribo, aru Isor logot milai loi kene ki dushmani thakise etu khotom kori bole nimite. <verse eid="EPH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17"/>Aru Khrista ahi kene jun dur te ase, aru jun usorte ase, duita jat ke shanti laga susamachar janai dise, <verse eid="EPH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18"/>kelemane Tai pora he amikhan duijon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yehudi aru porjati manu khan.</char></note> ke ekjon Atma bonai kene Baba Isor ke milai dise. <verse eid="EPH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19"/>Etu karone apuni khan etiya dusra desh aru nachina manu nohua hoise. Hoile bhi, etiya apnikhan to pobitro manu khan logote Isor laga ghor te thaki thaka manu hoi jaise. <verse eid="EPH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20"/>Apuni khan ke apostle aru bhabobadi khan laga mojbut kotha uporte bonaise, aru Jisu Khrista tai nijorke ekta bisi dorkar pathor dise<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa. 28:16; I Cor. 12:28.</char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21"/>Jun he dangor ghor ke eke logote mojbut pora dhuri rakhise, aru Probhu te ekta pobitro mondoli hoi kene uthi thakibi, <verse eid="EPH 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22"/>aru Khrista te apnikhan ke milai kene bonai dise, juntu te Isor laga Atma thaki jabo.<verse eid="EPH 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Susamachar Laga Kotha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1"/>Etu nimite moi, Paul, apuni Porjati khan nimite, Khrista Jisu laga bondhi ase. <verse eid="EPH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2"/>Jodi apuni Isor laga kripa kotha hunise juntu Isor pora moike dise apnikhan nimite, <verse eid="EPH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3"/>juntu moike prokahit kori dise, utu lukai kene rakha kotha juntu moi age te olop likhi loise. <verse eid="EPH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4"/>Jitia apuni etu kotha porhibo, apuni Khrista laga asurit aru bhitor kotha to bujhi bole paribo, <verse eid="EPH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5"/>poila te etu kotha to dusra jamana khan ke janai diya nai, hoile bhi ekta sob kotha he Atma pora tai laga pobitro apostle aru bhabobadi khan pora janai dise-- <verse eid="EPH 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6"/>aru Porjati khan bhi Jisu Khrista laga waris ase aru Tai laga gaw laga bhag ase aru susamachar laga kosom dwara taikhan bhi Isor diya kosom te bhag loise, <verse eid="EPH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7"/>etu nimite he moi Tai laga sewa korise, Isor laga anugrah pora kaam kori thaka aru asirbad morom moike dise. <verse eid="EPH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8"/>Moi pobitro manu bhitor te sobse chutu ase, Khrista laga bisarikena khotom kori bole napara dhun kotha Porjati khan ke prochar koribo nimite etu anugrah moike dise, <verse eid="EPH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9"/>aru sobke juntu tai laga asol maksad to ki ase etu dikhai dibo, ekta hosa kotha juntu Isor pora sob jinis bona homoi te lukai kene rakhidise- <verse eid="EPH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10"/>etu hoile girja dwara he sob cholawta aru adhikari khan, jun sorgo jagate ase, taikhan Isor laga bisi kisim gyaan thaka to janibole pabo, <verse eid="EPH 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11"/>kitia bhi khotom nohobole bhabona juntu Isor pora amikhan laga Probhu Khrista Jisu logote korise, <verse eid="EPH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12"/>amikhan Khrista logote biswas pora mon dangor kori kene tai usorte jabo. <verse eid="EPH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13"/>Etu nimite moi anurodh kori ase apuni khan ke, mon chutu na koribi kelemane moi dukh pa to apnikhan laga labh hobole nimite ase.<verse eid="EPH 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Atma Te Takot Hobole Prathana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14"/>Etu nimite moi Baba Isor usorte athukari kene ase, <verse eid="EPH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15"/>jun pora sob dol laga ghor manu khan ke sorgo aru prithibi te naam dise, <verse eid="EPH 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16"/>titia Isor laga dhun aru morom laga asis pora apuni ke dibo aru apuni laga bhitor te thaka manu ke Atma pora takot koribo, <verse eid="EPH 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17"/>etu hoile Khrista apuni laga mon bhitor te biswas dwara thakibo paribo, aru morom te thaki bole paribo, <verse eid="EPH 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18"/>titia apuni sob pobitro manu khan logote milikena bujhi bole paribo, kiman lamba aru kiman bhitor, aru kiman untcha ase, <verse eid="EPH 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19"/>aru Khrista laga morom bujhi bo paribo, etu morom to gyaan pora bhi bisi dangor ase, etu sob to Isor laga bhal kaam pora amikhan uporte bhorta hoi jabo.<verse eid="EPH 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20"/>Isor usorte amikhan ki mangile bhi aru bhabona korile bhi sob to kori diye, aru juntu takot amikhan ke chulai ase etu laga itcha te he sob to pura hoi jabo, <verse eid="EPH 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21"/>Isor ke mohima hobi girja te aru Khrista Jisu dwara ahibole yug sob te, etiya pora hodai nimite. Amen.<verse eid="EPH 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Khrista Laga Sarir Te Milikena Thaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1"/>Etu nimite ami Isor laga bondhi ghor te thaka manu, apnikhan ke utsah kori ase juntu kaam kori bole apnikhan ke matise utu thik pora kori kene berabi, <verse eid="EPH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2"/>nomro aru norom hoi kene, dhorjo kori kene, ekjon-ekjon ke morom te thakibi, <verse eid="EPH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3"/>shanti pora Atma bhitor te ekta hoi kene thaki bole kosis koribi. <verse eid="EPH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4"/>Ekjon he gaw ase, aru ekjon Pobitro Atma ase, jineka apnikhan ke ekta bhabona kori kene mati sele, <verse eid="EPH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5"/>ekjon Isor, ekta biswas, ekta baptizma, <verse eid="EPH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6"/>Ekjon Isor aru sob laga Baba, jun sob laga uporte ase, aru sob pora ase, aru sob bhitor te ase. <verse eid="EPH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7"/>Etiya amikhan sobke anugrah dikene ase Khrista laga inam laga ujon hisab te. <verse eid="EPH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8"/>Etu nimite tai koise:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">“Jitia tai uporte uthise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">Tai dhuri kene thaka khan ke dhuri kene loi jaise,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">Aru manu khan ke inam khan dise<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Psa. 68:18</char></note>.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9"/>To etu laga motlob to ki ase “Khrista uthise,” hoilebi tai prithibi laga sob pora niche bhag te bhi jaise<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Heb. 2:9; John 3:13.</char></note>? <verse eid="EPH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10"/>Tai jun nichete jaise utu tai he ase jun sob sorgo khan pora bisi uporte bhi uthise, titia Tai sob jinis khan ke bhorta kori bole paribo. <verse eid="EPH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11"/>Aru Khrista pora kunba ke apostle, kunba ke bhabobadi, kunba ke procharok, aru kunba ke palok aru hikhok kori bole dise<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">2 Cor. 12:28-29.</char></note>, <verse eid="EPH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12"/>pobitro manu khan ke thik kori bole nimite, mantri khan laga kaam khan aru Khrista laga gaw ke hikai dibole nimite, <verse eid="EPH 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13"/>Isor laga chokra laga gyaan te ekta biswas te napuncha tak, ekta pura aru thik manu hobo nimite, pura Khrista nisena, <verse eid="EPH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14"/>titia amikhan aru bacha nisena nahobo, age piche nahilibo, niyom laga sob hawa te loi najabo, manu khan laga thoga baji te, aru chalak kaam khan te nagiribo. <verse eid="EPH 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15"/>Kintu morom pora hosa kotha kobo, aru sob jinis te uthibo, Tai logote jun matha ase, Khrista nijor, <verse eid="EPH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16"/>Jun pora pura gaw thik pora mili kene ekta hoijai, aru bhag sob pora nijor kaam kori kene ekta bhag logote ekta bhag mili jai, etu pora gaw ke hikai, nijor pora morom te bonai uthibole.<verse eid="EPH 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Notun Jibon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17"/>Etu nimite ami koi ase, aru Probhu naam te utsah di ase, etiya pora apnikhan Porjati khan misa-misi bhabona te thakikena bera nisena na koribi. <verse eid="EPH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18"/>Bujhi bole para takot to andhar te rakhi kene ase, aru Isor laga jibon pora alag hoi kene ase, kele koile taikhan monte buddhi nai aru Isor ke taikhan laga mon tan hoi kene thaka nimite. <verse eid="EPH 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19"/>Jun khan nijor bhabona ke morai dise, aru nijorke bebichari kaam nimite cholai se, aru gaw mangso kaam te berai thakise. <verse eid="EPH 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20"/>Hoile bhi apnikhan eneka pora Khrista laga kotha hika nai, <verse eid="EPH 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21"/>eneka hoile apnikhan utu hobi juntu apnikhan tai laga hunise, aru Jisu pora jineka hikai se, juntu hosa to Jisu bhitor te ase. <verse eid="EPH 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22"/>Titia apnikhan utu purana manu laga poila kotha khan phelai dibi, juntu misa-misi ase thoga baji laga lalchi khan ase, <verse eid="EPH 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23"/>Aru apnikhan laga bhabona laga atma te notun hobi, <verse eid="EPH 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24"/>Aru ta te apuni khan utu notun manu hobi jun Isor laga protima ase- dharmikta aru pobitrota te<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Col. 3:10; 1 Cor. 5:17.</char></note>.<verse eid="EPH 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25"/>Etu nimite misa phelai dibi, sob manu dusra manu logote hosa kotha kobi kele koile amikhan ekjon-dusra-jon laga bhag ase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Col. 3:9; Rom. 12:5; Zec. 8:16.</char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26"/>Apnikhan khong hobi, aru paap na koribi: apnikhan laga khong uporte din khotom hobole nadibi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Psa. 4:4.</char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27"/>Bhoot khan ke bhal homoi to nadibi. <verse eid="EPH 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28"/>Taikhan jun khan chor kore, taikhan chor nakori jabi. Ulta, tai kaam kori bole lage, tai laga hath khan pora utu kaam khan kori bole dibi juntu bhal ase hoile bhi, titia tai dusra ke dibole paribo junke dorkar ase. <verse eid="EPH 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29"/>Apnikhan laga mukh pora misa-misi kotha khan ulabole nadibi, hoile bhi juntu kotha dusra ke uthai dibole nimite bhal ase, eneka pora huni thaka khan anugrah pabo. <verse eid="EPH 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30"/>Aru Isor laga Pobitro Atma ke mon dukh kori bole nadibi, juntu pora apuni khan ke paap pora bachai diya laga dinte daag dise<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eph. 1:13-14; Isa. 63:10.</char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31"/>Sob tita khan, biya pa-a, khong, hala, aru gali diya khan apnikhan pora hatai dibi, sob biya laga bhabona khan. <verse eid="EPH 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32"/>Aru ekjon-ekjon ke morom koribi, norom mon rakhibi, maph koribi, jineka Isor pora Khrista dwara apnikhan ke maph korise.<verse eid="EPH 4:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Morom Te Thakibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1"/>Etu karone, Isor pora morom kora bacha khan nisena, apnikhan bhi Isor laga niyom khan koribo lage, <verse eid="EPH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2"/>aru morom te bera bhi, jineka Khrista amikhan ke morom korise aru amikhan nimite tai laga jibon Isor ke ekta mitha sugandh thaka nisena bolidan dise<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">John 13:34; Gal. 2:20</char></note>.<verse eid="EPH 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3"/>Kintu bebichari aru letera kaam khan aru lalchi huwa, etu kaam khan pora apnikhan uporte bodnam hobo nadibi kele koile apnikhan pobitro manu ase, <verse eid="EPH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4"/>aru letera aru murkho kotha khan nohoile bhi biya kotha pora dhamali kora thik nai kintu dhanyavad diya laga kotha he kobi. <verse eid="EPH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5"/>Etu bhal pora jani bhi, bebichari, nohoile letera, nohoile lalchi, aru murti puja kora- eitu khan sob Khrista aru Isor laga rajyote jaga napabo. <verse eid="EPH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6"/>Kun manu pora bhi apnike eku motlob nathaka kotha pora thogabo nadibi, kele koile etu kotha namana bacha khan uporte Isor laga khong to ahibo. <verse eid="EPH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7"/>Etu karone, eneka manu khan logote namili bhi, <verse eid="EPH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8"/>kele koile poila apnikhan andhera te thakise, kintu etiya apnikhan Probhu logote ujala te ase. Ujala laga bacha nisena berabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eph. 5:8</char></note> <verse eid="EPH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9"/>-kele koile puhor laga phol to sob bhal niyom, dharmikta aru hosa khan ase-, <verse eid="EPH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10"/>Hoshiar pora Probhu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yate, Probhu to Isor hobo pare</char></note> laga itcha janikena thakibi. <verse eid="EPH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11"/>Andhera te phol nadhura kaam kora manu khan logot namilibi, hoile bhi taikhan ke ujala te anibi. <verse eid="EPH 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12"/>Kilekoile taikhan lukai kene kora kaam khan kobole bhi sorom ase. <verse eid="EPH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13"/>Kintu pohor te sob jinis khan dikhi jai, kelemane ki dikhi bole pare, etu sob pohor ase. <verse eid="EPH 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14"/>Etu nimite Isor kotha te eneka likha ase,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">“Uthi bhi, jun ghumai ase,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">Aru mora pora uthi jabi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">Aru Khrista laga pohor apuni uporte ahibo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Poila Khristan gana hobo pare</char></note>.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15"/>Hoshiar pora sai thakibi, apuni kineka berai- murkho manu nisena nohoi kintu gyaani nisena, <verse eid="EPH 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16"/>homoi to para tak chola bhi kele koile din khan biya ase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amos 5:13; Col. 4:5</char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17"/>Etu nimite, murkho nahobi, kintu Probhu laga ki itcha ase etu bujhi bole koribi. <verse eid="EPH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18"/>Modhu pora nisa nohobi, kelemane etu pora apuni laga jibon sob khotom kori dibo. Kintu, Pobitro Atma pora bhorta hoi kene thakibi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pro. 23:31-32; Gal. 5:21-25</char></note>, <verse eid="EPH 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19"/>ekjon-ekjon logote bhajan aru gana khan, aru pobitro gana khan, Probhu ke apuni laga mon bhitor pora gana kora khan aru sundur pora bajana koribi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Col. 3:16; 1 Cor. 14:26</char></note>, <verse eid="EPH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20"/>Sob homoi te Baba Isor aru amikhan laga Probhu Jisu Khrista laga naam te dhanyavad dibi, <verse eid="EPH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21"/>Pura mon pora Khrista karone nijorke ekjon-ekjon logot mili kene thakibi.<verse eid="EPH 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shadi Kora Mota Aru Maiki Nimite Kotha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22"/>Isor ke diya nisena, maiki khan nijor mota ke pura mon pora sabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Col. 3:18; 1 Pet. 3:1; Gen. 3:16</char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23"/>Kilekoile ekjon mota to maiki laga matha ase jineka Khrista ekta girja laga matha ase- tai nije he ekjon gaw laga tran-korta ase. <verse eid="EPH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24"/>Etu nimite jineka girja to Khrista nichete ase, etu nisena maiki khan sob tai laga mota nimite ase. <verse eid="EPH 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25"/>Mota khan, apnikhan laga maiki khan ke morom koribi jineka Khrista tai laga girja ke korise aru etu nimite tai nije ke di dise, <verse eid="EPH 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26"/>Titia tai pora eitu khan ke pobitro kori dibo, taike Isor kotha loi kene pani pora dhulai sapha kori dibo, <verse eid="EPH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27"/>titia Khrista nijor nimite ekta sonman laga girja ase koi kene dibo, eku bhi dagi nathaki kene nohoile bhi tera, nohoile bhi dusra eku bhi biya nathaka, kintu titia tai pobitro aru eku bhi galti nathaka hobo. <verse eid="EPH 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28"/>Etu nisena mota khan bhi nijor maiki ke nijor gaw nisena morom koribo lage. Jun mota nijor maiki ke morom kore tai nijorke morom kora nisena ase. <verse eid="EPH 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29"/>Kilekoile kunbi nijor gaw ke biya nalage, kintu tai bhal pora khilai aru sapha rakhe, jineka Khrista tai laga girja ke morom kore. <verse eid="EPH 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30"/>Kelemane amikhan tai laga gaw laga bhag khan ase. <verse eid="EPH 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31"/>“Etu karone ekjon mota tai nijor baba aru ama ke chari kene nijor maiki logote ekta gaw hoi kene thake<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gen. 2:24</char></note>.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32"/>Etu ekta bisi dangor bujhi bo napara kotha ase, kintu ami Khrista aru girja laga kotha koi ase. <verse eid="EPH 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33"/>Kineka hoile bhi, apuni khan sobke koi ase, nijorke morom kora nisena nijor maiki ke morom koribi, aru maiki khan nijor mota ke sonman dibo lage.<verse eid="EPH 5:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6"/>
  <para style="s">Ama Baba Aru Bacha Khan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1"/>Bacha khan, Probhu dwara ama baba laga kotha mani bhi, kele koile etu he thik ase. <verse eid="EPH 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2"/>“Tumi laga baba aru ama ke sonman koribi” -juntu poila hukum ase kosom thaki kene-, <verse eid="EPH 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3"/>“Titia tumi nimite bhal hobo, aru tumi prithibi te lamba jibon thaki bole paribo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Exo. 20:12; Deu. 5:16</char></note>.” <verse eid="EPH 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4"/>Baba khan, apnikhan laga bacha khan ke khong hobole nadibi. Hoile bhi, taikhan ke Isor laga niyom te aru hisab te dangor koribi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Deu. 6:7; Pro. 3:11-12; 22:6; Col. 3:2</char></note>.<verse eid="EPH 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5"/>Sewak khan, tumikhan laga mon sapha pora, malik logote kotha mani kene, bhoi pora aru kapi kene thaki bhi, jineka Khrista usorte thake, <verse eid="EPH 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6"/>khali suku usorte nohoi, jineka manu khan ke khushi kori bole nimite kore, hoile bhi Khrista laga noukar khan nisena, atma pora Isor laga monjur koribi, <verse eid="EPH 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7"/>bhal niyom pora sewa koribi Isor laga naam pora, manu laga naam pora nohoikena, <verse eid="EPH 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8"/>jani bhi jun manu bhal kaam koribo, etu manu Isor pora pabo, tai nokor hoile bhi nahoile ajad thaka hoile bhi.<verse eid="EPH 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9"/>Malik khan, taikhan nimite bhi eneka he kori bhi. Gali kene bhoi nakhila bhi. Apnikhan jani ase, apnikhan aru taikhan laga Malik sorgote ase, aru Tai logot te eku bhagsak nai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luke 6:31; Deu. 10:17; 2 Chr. 19:7</char></note>.<verse eid="EPH 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isor Laga Lorai Hathiar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10"/>Hekh te, Probhu logote thakibi aru tai laga takot te sakti pabi. <verse eid="EPH 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11"/>Isor laga sob hathiar khan lagai lobi, titia apnikhan bhoot laga chalak khan bhirodh te khara kori bole paribo.<verse eid="EPH 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12"/>Kilekoile amikhan gaw mangso aru khun logote lorai kora nohoi, hoile bhi biya niyom khan logote, biya takot khan logote, etu duniya laga andhar-laga-rajakhan laga biya khan logote, utcha jaga khan te thaka biya atma khan logote lorai kori ase. <verse eid="EPH 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13"/>Etu nimite apuni khan Isor laga hathiar khan loi lobi, titia apuni khan biya dinte khara hobole paribo, aru sob kori kene, khara hobo. <verse eid="EPH 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14"/>Khara hobi, apuni laga komor te hosa bandi lobi, aru chati te dharmikta bandi lobi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa. 11:5; 59:17</char></note>, <verse eid="EPH 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15"/>aru apuni laga theng khan te susamachar laga shanti nimite juta lagai kene taiyar koribi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa. 52:7; Nah. 1:15</char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16"/>Sob somoite, biswas laga dhal lobi, etu hoile biya jon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Saitan</char></note> pora jui laga tir mari thaka to khotom kori bole paribo. <verse eid="EPH 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17"/>Aru poritran laga loha-laga-topi pindhi lobi, aru Atma laga dao, juntu Isor laga kotha ase<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa. 49:2; Heb. 4:12; Isa. 59:17</char></note>. <verse eid="EPH 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18"/>Sob somoite Pobitro Atma pora prathana kori bhi, ki lagi ase etu sob mangi kene prathana koribi. Etu sob koribo nimite, hodai taiyar aru hoshiar thakibi aru pobitro manu khan nimite hodai prathana koribi, <verse eid="EPH 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19"/>Aru ami nimite to, kotha kobole nimite sandesh dibi, tine hole ami bhoi nakori kene mukh khuli bo, susamachar laga lukai kene rakha janai dibole nimite. <verse eid="EPH 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20"/>-Juntu nimite moi noukar hoi kene ekjon janai diya manu ase-, titia moi bhoi nakori kene kobo, jineka moi kobo lage.<verse eid="EPH 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hekh Laga Salam Kotha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21"/>Aru ami ki kori ase, kineka kori ase apuni khan bhi janibo, Tychicus, Probhu te thaka ekjon morom aru biswas thaka bhai pora apnikhan ke koi dibo, <verse eid="EPH 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22"/>Junke moi apnikhan usorte thik etu nimite he pathai ase, titia amikhan laga kaam khan janibole paribo, aru apnikhan laga mon dangor hobo.<verse eid="EPH 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23"/>Sob bhai khan logote shanti aru morom thakibi, biswas pora Baba Isor aru Jisu khrista te. <verse eid="EPH 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24"/>Aru kunkhan Probhu Jisu Khrista ke kitia bhi biya nohobole laga morom kore taikhan logote Isor laga anugraha hobo dibi.<verse eid="EPH 6:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6"/>
</usx>
